# `cell init` refuses a plan as lost only when every member is wiped, not
# when it lost its quorum: an init of a lost cell goes on, and its reply
# is not `cell_lost`. The convergence oracle skips a run whose cell is
# lost, so the `cell init` oracles must catch it.
